summary.label:
Umico is a super application that combines an online store and a loyalty program. Shop right in the app with home delivery.

Umico Market is the first mobile marketplace in Azerbaijan. More than 20 categories, more than 200,000 products where both adults and children will find something of their own. It is possible to compare products. Convenient delivery to your home and nearest pickup points. Payment is made by credit card or cash. You don't have to worry about shipping as you can track your item right in the app. Choose the right product at the lowest price among different sellers.

Choose from over 200,000 products in the following categories:
• Mobile phones, smartphones, laptops, headphones;
• Smart watches and fitness bands;
• Household appliances;
• Perfumes;
• Goods for home and kitchen;
• and even more!

Gather the perfect wardrobe - clothes are now on Umico Market, as well! Choose stylish clothes with great prices:
• Women's and men's clothing;
• Hoodies | sweatshirts
• Shirts | Blouses
• T-shirts | Polo
• Dresses | Skirts
• Pants | Jeans
• Outerwear
• Home | Sportswear


Your shopping experience should be as comfortable as possible. With Umico, buy everything you need and get it straight to your home, get cashback in stores and save on purchases. Install the app and make sure yourself!
